 * 2. Attempt to update the newly created user role with invalid payloads
 *    using PUT /bbs/userRoles/{id}. Specifically:
 *    a. Both fields present but empty strings
 *    b. name is an empty string, description is valid
 *    c. description is an empty string, name is valid
 *    d. name and/or description is null (where permitted)
 *    e. name and/or description is improper type (numbers or arrays)
 * 3. For each invalid input, verify:
 *    - API returns an error response describing what was wrong.
 *    - User role data is NOT modified (remains as initially created).
 *    - The error message is user-readable and references the specific validation issue.
