/**
 * Search and list posts with filtering and pagination (BBS: posts table).
 *
 * This API allows users to list and search through discussion posts on the BBS
 * platform by querying the 'posts' table. The endpoint supports pagination,
 * keyword search, category-based filtering, sorting by date or popularity, and
 * other advanced query options as per best practice standards.
 *
